# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkcloud Pinnacle and Whitereach Post

step Darkcloud Pinnacle
  tip West of Freewind, the Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle. The Secret Notes are in Document Chests at the south-east, south-west and north-west camps.
  interact 190484 quest 5064.3 @39.3,41.5 map 1441 -- Document Chest, south-east camp
  interact 190483 quest 5064.2 @33.8,40.0 map 1441 -- Document Chest, south-west camp
  interact 176344 quest 5064.1 @31.8,32.6 map 1441 -- Document Chest, north-west camp

step Level 28
  when level<28
  tip Short of 28? The Grimtotem around these camps (25-28) are the right level: kill a few more before the climb to Lakota. Past it, this step skips itself. Or, with a group, run the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon instead.
  goto 35.0,31.5 map 1441 "Grimtotem camps below Darkcloud Pinnacle"
  level 28 grind 10759                -- grind on Grimtotem Stomper

step Lakota Windsong
  tip Great Lift detour warning: the arrow may miss the path up Darkcloud Pinnacle. If you are on the canyon floor, follow the path and rope bridges up Darkcloud Pinnacle. Lakota Windsong is held captive beside Arnak Grimtotem (29): clear the guards and Arnak first, then free her and protect her on the walk down; Grimtotem ambushers come at you on the way.
  collect 12884 quest 5147 @38.1,26.9 -- Arnak Grimtotem
  accept 4904 @37.95,26.45            -- Lakota Windsong
  complete 4904

step Highperch
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip West of Whitereach the wyverns nest on the Highperch cliffs; the eggs lie in the nests. Pao'ka Swiftmountain waits on the east side of the nesting grounds: free him and keep him alive on the walk back to Whitereach Post.
  tip Careful: Wyverns at level 28-29 fly overhead and can be pulled without warning. A group of three wyverns can ambush you once you pass the first pillar at the bottom. Highperch Patriarchs (30-31) and the rare Heartrazor (32) nest here too: pull around them.
  collect 12356 quest 4767
  accept 4770                         -- Pao'ka Swiftmountain
  complete 4770

